```slide points
id: g1
title: Why talk about agents now?
items:
- heading: They work on a goal, not a question
- heading: They use tools and files
- heading: They report back when they are done
```

Agents change who does the steps. You still decide what good looks like.

```slide boxes
id: g2
title: A scheduled prompt, step by step
look: line
items:
- heading: When
  text: Every Monday at 8:00
- heading: What it reads
  text: The week's new emails
- heading: What it writes
  text: Three groups and two drafts
- heading: Who it tells
  text: You, in one message
```

The first agent most people use is a prompt that runs on a schedule.
